      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغضّب</span></b>  <i>He became angered</i> or <i>angry:</i> (S:)
or <i>he was angry somewhat after</i> [<i>having been so</i>]
<i>somewhat.</i> (Ham p. 522.) See also 1, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغضّبت القِدْرُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>The cooking-pot
boiled fiercely</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى اللَّحْمِ</span> [<i>upon the flesh-meat</i>].
(TA.)

